    {
      "text": "High settings leave room for wedding bands.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "mix585-render-side.webp"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Photo guides name five angles, and a jewelry render can show each.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "grid",
        "srcs": [
          "mix585-render-front.webp",
          "mix585-render-top.webp",
          "mix585-render-three-quarter.webp",
          "mix585-render-back.webp"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The front view, straight on, is usually the main photo.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "mix585-render-front.webp",
        "label": "Front"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The side shows the band's height and the setting's profile.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "mix585-render-side.webp",
        "label": "Side"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The top shows the stone and how the small stones sit.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "mix585-render-top.webp",
        "label": "Top"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A three-quarter view adds depth, so you see height and structure.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "mix585-render-three-quarter.webp",
        "label": "Three-quarter"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The back view shows the setting from behind.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "mix585-render-back.webp",
        "label": "Back"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Etsy lets a listing hold 20 photos and suggests several angles.",
      "say": "Etsy lets a listing hold twenty photos and suggests several angles.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "20 photos",
        "sub": "Etsy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A high setting can catch on clothes,",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "mix585-render-side.webp",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.2,
          "k": 1.8
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "but it leaves room for a wedding band to sit flush.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "mix585-render-side.webp",
        "marks": [
          {
            "x": 0.46,
            "y": 0.7,
            "text": "Wedding band",
            "at": 0.5
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "All five views here are renders of one 3D file.",
      "say": "All five views here are renders of one three D file.",
